40431742,14,Which drug classes were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,None,"Treatment-naive, defined as no antiretrovirals (in combination or monotherapy) received before resistance test based on clinical records.","The study population was defined as treatment-naive, meaning they had not received any antiretrovirals before the resistance test."
40431742,15,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,None,"Treatment-naive, defined as no antiretrovirals (in combination or monotherapy) received before resistance test based on clinical records.","The study population was defined as treatment-naive, meaning they had not received any antiretrovirals before the resistance test."
