40713598,5,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,Ghana,Participants included CAWH from a previous study that examined the virologic response to NNRTI-based ART from the Pediatric HIV/AIDS Care Program at Korle-Bu Teaching Hospital in Ghana [8].,The study population was from the Pediatric HIV/AIDS Care Program at Korle-Bu Teaching Hospital in Ghana.
