40713598,7,What method was used for sequencing?,Next-generation sequencing (NGS) was conducted on the Illumina MiSeq platform following previously published protocols.,"HIV-1 pol was amplified using two-round PCR, and next-generation sequencing (NGS) was conducted on the Illumina MiSeq platform following previously published protocols.",The paper mentions that next-generation sequencing (NGS) was conducted on the Illumina MiSeq platform.
