40839365,4,Which HIV genes were reported to have been sequenced?,"protease, reverse transcriptase, integrase","99.5% (212/213) were genotyped with an amplification rate of 95.8% (204/212) for protease, reverse transcriptase, and integrase (PR, RT, and IN) regions and with a 100% sequencing success rate for integrase strand transfer inhibitor (INSTI) region","The paper reports genotypic analysis of the protease, reverse transcriptase, and integrase genes."
40839365,5,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,Malawi,We conducted a national HIV drug resistance (HIVDR) survey in adults on DBR with high viral load (VL) results after intensive adherence counseling (IAC).,"The study was conducted in Malawi, and all samples were obtained from this country."
