40974886,2,Does the paper report in vitro drug susceptibility data?,No.,The study does not mention any in vitro drug susceptibility data or phenotypic testing results.,"The primary focus of the paper is on genotypic resistance and the detection of resistance-associated mutations (RAMs) over time, rather than on in vitro drug susceptibility data."
