41029850,14,Which drug classes were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"The individuals in the study received NRTI, NNRTI, PI/r, and INSTI drug classes before sample sequencing.","Out of 203 individuals, 34 (16.80%), 160 (78.70%) and 9 (4.50%) were on first, second and third line ART respectively. Detailed regimens included: ABC + 3TC + EFV/NVP (0.98%); AZT + 3TC + EFV/NVP (1.47%); TDF + 3TC + EFV/NVP (6.89%); TDF + 3TC + DTG (7.39%); AZT + 3TC + DTG (0.49%); ABC + 3TC + DTG (3.94%); ABC + 3TC + ATV/r (17.73%); ABC + 3TC + LPV/r (6.40%); AZT + 3TC + ATV/r (15.76%), AZT + 3TC + LVP/r (5.42%); TDF + 3TC + ATV/r (29.56%); TDF + 3TC + LPV/r (3.94%).","The study mentions detailed regimens including drugs from these classes for individuals on first, second, and third line ART."
41029850,15,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"The raw regime before individual sample sequencing for HIV genotypic resistance testing (GRT) included ABC + 3TC + EFV/NVP (0.98%); AZT + 3TC + EFV/NVP (1.47%); TDF + 3TC + EFV/NVP (6.89%); TDF + 3TC + DTG (7.39%); AZT + 3TC + DTG (0.49%); ABC + 3TC + DTG (3.94%); ABC + 3TC + ATV/r (17.73%); ABC + 3TC + LPV/r (6.40%); AZT + 3TC + ATV/r (15.76%), AZT + 3TC + LVP/r (5.42%); TDF + 3TC + ATV/r (29.56%); TDF + 3TC + LPV/r (3.94%). and from the tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF), tenofovir alafenamide (TAF), abacavir (ABC), lamivudine (3TC), efavirenz (EFV), nevirapine (NVP), dolutegravir (DTG), atazanavir (ATV), lopinavir (LPV), darunavir (DRV), raltegravir (RAL), elvitegravir (EVG), and doravirine (DOR).","Out of 203 individuals, 34 (16.80%), 160 (78.70%) and 9 (4.50%) were on first, second and third line ART respectively. Detailed regimens included: ABC + 3TC + EFV/NVP (0.98%); AZT + 3TC + EFV/NVP (1.47%); TDF + 3TC + EFV/NVP (6.89%); TDF + 3TC + DTG (7.39%); AZT + 3TC + DTG (0.49%); ABC + 3TC + DTG (3.94%); ABC + 3TC + ATV/r (17.73%); ABC + 3TC + LPV/r (6.40%); AZT + 3TC + ATV/r (15.76%), AZT + 3TC + LVP/r (5.42%); TDF + 3TC + ATV/r (29.56%); TDF + 3TC + LPV/r (3.94%).",The paper lists the specific regimens and drugs that were used by individuals before sequencing their samples.
