Proviral DNA was extracted from the whole-blood sample collected in 2025 with the Viral DNA Extraction Kit (Supbio, China).",The paper specifies that viral RNA was extracted from plasma and proviral DNA was extracted from whole blood.
41088231,10,Were any sequences obtained from individuals with virological failure on a treatment regimen?,No,"In the previous drug resistance surveillance among 5602 HIV-1-infected antiretroviral therapy (ART)-naive individuals in Guangdong Province from Jan. 2023 to Dec. 2023, we identified one partial pol gene sequence in a plasma specimen collected from an HIV-1-infected patient, 230794, as a suspected recombinant of subtype F2 and CRF02_AG, two subtypes of HIV that are very rare in China and even worldwide.
The baseline HIV-1 viral load was  (3.95×105 )IU/mL, and the CD4+ T-cell count was 77 cells/μL.","The paper describes patient 230794 as antiretroviral therapy (ART)-naive at the time of sample collection 230794 was 47 years old and got infected via heterosexual contact in Guangzhou City, Guangdong Province. His spouse was negative for HIV-1. The baseline HIV-1 viral load was  (3.95×105 )IU/mL, and the CD4+ T-cell count was 77 cells/μL. these values indicated that this patient was in the advanced stage of HIV-1 infection, which had not been identified and treated in a timely manner, resulting in severe immune system damage. This indicates the individual had not previously received ARVs before sampling."
